{"method":{"methodHash":"f830378f12e05854e193d72cb6f5a82e","typeHash":"e54f21c2b7b67a13241dc332527b9d00","name":"UpdateProgress","filePath":"/Users/pratiksinghthakur/perproj/dotnet/Aimmy/Aimmy2/Visuality/PerformanceHelperWindow.xaml.cs","bodySpan":{"startLine":468,"startColumn":9,"endLine":483,"endColumn":10},"calls":[{"span":{"startLine":470,"startColumn":29,"endLine":470,"endColumn":82},"calleeMethodHash":null,"calleeDisplayName":"Max"},{"span":{"startLine":473,"startColumn":46,"endLine":473,"endColumn":85},"calleeMethodHash":null,"calleeDisplayName":"Clamp"},{"span":{"startLine":475,"startColumn":17,"endLine":475,"endColumn":87},"calleeMethodHash":null,"calleeDisplayName":"Equals"}]},"lines":["        private void UpdateProgress(PerformanceBenchmarkProgress progress)","        {","            int remaining = Math.Max(0, progress.TotalSteps - progress.StepIndex);","            double percent = progress.TotalSteps == 0","                ? 0","                : ((progress.StepIndex - 1 \u002B Math.Clamp(progress.StepProgress, 0, 1)) * 100.0) / progress.TotalSteps;","","            if (progress.Status.Equals(\u0022Complete\u0022, StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase))","            {","                percent = 100;","            }","","            ProgressTitle.Text = $\u0022Step {progress.StepIndex} of {progress.TotalSteps}\u0022;","            ProgressSubtitle.Text = $\u0022{progress.Status}. {remaining} size checks left.\u0022;","            BenchmarkProgressBar.Value = percent;","        }"],"startLine":468}